WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.425
Actual M8 Community in the authenticated PWA. All accounts and messages are isolated synthetic review fixtures.

2
00:00:03.425 --> 00:00:05.492
Enter adds a line. Only the visible send-arrow button publishes the message.

3
00:00:05.492 --> 00:00:07.459
Hover, long-press or Shift+F10 opens contextual replies, reactions and private reporting.

4
00:00:07.459 --> 00:00:09.630
Use the attachment plus and Website content for a short list of real public website titles, previews and linked message text.

5
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.515
Tap the group title for actual role holders and the alphabetical member directory. Admin is a separate official sender.

6
00:00:11.515 --> 00:00:14.742
Typing is shown under the group title and as initials with dots above the composer.

7
00:00:14.742 --> 00:00:18.984
Administrator restrictions retain history and show a locked footer with private assistance.

8
00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:20.967
Message admin opens a private, persisted support request. No case content is published to the group.

9
00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:26.721
The enabled preview is restored through the real administrator policy. Production remains untouched; new databases still default closed.
